{{!--
    The chronicle: what has happened, newest first.

    It stands beside the Plot list rather than inside a Plot, because the question
    it answers — "what has moved since we last played?" — is not asked about one
    Plot at a time.

    Every line was built in _prepareContext against this viewer. A development
    about something the table may not know exists arrives here as its note alone,
    with nothing attached to say what it was about; one about a masked row arrives
    with "???" where the name would be; one the GM kept to themselves does not
    arrive at all. There is nothing left to hide at this layer.

    `seen` is set for the GM alone, on any line the table reads less of than they
    do — either because the GM said so when they wrote it, or because it was
    sealed by what was secret at the time.
--}}
<aside class="rsr-log" aria-label="{{localize 'RSR.log.title'}}">

    <header class="rsr-log-head">
        <h3>{{localize "RSR.log.title"}}</h3>
        {{#if @root.isGM}}
        <button type="button" class="rsr-icon-btn" data-action="clearLog"
                data-tooltip="{{localize 'RSR.log.clearHint'}}">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-broom" inert></i>
        </button>
        {{/if}}
    </header>

    {{#if log.length}}
    <ol class="rsr-log-list">
        {{#each log}}
        <li class="rsr-log-row{{#if this.masked}} is-veiled{{/if}}">
            <i class="rsr-log-icon {{this.icon}}" inert></i>
            <span class="rsr-log-when">{{this.when}}</span>
            {{#if this.seen}}
            <span class="rsr-chip rsr-chip-veil rsr-log-seen"
                  data-tooltip="{{localize 'RSR.log.seenChipHint'}}">{{localize this.seen}}</span>
            {{/if}}
            {{#if this.text}}
            <p class="rsr-log-text">{{this.text}}</p>
            {{/if}}
            {{#if this.note}}
            <p class="rsr-log-note">{{this.note}}</p>
            {{/if}}
            {{#if this.cost}}
            <span class="rsr-log-cost" data-tooltip="{{localize 'RSR.log.costHint'}}">
                {{numberFormat this.cost sign=true}}
            </span>
            {{/if}}
        </li>
        {{/each}}
    </ol>
    {{else}}
    <p class="rsr-empty rsr-log-empty">{{localize "RSR.log.empty"}}</p>
    {{/if}}

</aside>
